{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30011_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:33d8ad146a2370b15753a62d200eacfe8e29d224262d329798f9d48da2f9d2bf",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51121bfdb0dc1304ef79c23c3ea66a5b027838eec95fb23ae18e5bdc1d06d480",
      "text": "坦白说，我们的预算并不是很充裕……\n如果做法过于繁复，恐怕会有些吃力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0511ebe16973e6bbf935a1b39b6bb3bd026697d8611a735d73a3a2f56ae1a3f9",
      "text": "原来如此，竟有这层缘由……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9942e505510a806c2e138103502d054ea8cc4d2c8749ea48b6462e15124c1cb3",
      "text": "既然有这样的难处那也没办法。\n我们就挑力所能及的范围来做吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a95e143ea34a2a8e8fbac0d012925c46800c4d109359e49950e68e595da2046c",
      "text": "确实喵！此外能够做到的事情\n还有好多好多喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f04d583365ca361ee9ad619ecac7cf44c90f0b0c8d29236713d2a7cf07af5f15",
      "text": "不，我们来做吧！\n请不必顾虑预算的问题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e91a671145d5420f093d6c667ec2af08ffce89f6ab1a2d3e25882a93e3a0b9d",
      "text": "这话是什么意思呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fb8d9be43e946435deadefea1c4b38fc1a8cd1b3f0b32be7ffa578272240452",
      "text": "可是制作人，该如何解决呢？\n需要花费额外资金是事实啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:120d531ad649bc0f73478fd7e7f94ef6a94ef56f746bd78785b6eceded7a6ed0",
      "text": "难道说，你已经有什么好主意了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c298af745672dc50a5022965a4ff49f1bd6a4c9d98855ba6c6dfdba10b31b865",
      "text": "是的。我们可以采取由315 Production进行赞助的形式，\n仅参与接下来的这一届展览会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9ef78a3ade45ff9de2e6224147c407178dd8a082621f6f6be0935d1b1b52e8c",
      "text": "这样一来，应该就能控制在预算范围之内了。\n社长那边，由我去进行说明！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb19568a9c6976b8ffec9ef60b002fcb765f6c436d0dcdfab6249dbe32da1a84",
      "text": "（噢噢～！真不愧是制作人君喵！\n两人的表情也一下子都放晴了喵♪）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0983ba652122a034c445c1e3e4c6681e46ab8e06dc5eb162b88fd58b894e1f1d",
      "text": "如果真的能做到的话，那可就太感激不尽了……\n但真的，没有问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aad1feee7bd9461e4aa412d020790e6b4806bcebf336a3bfdf35f03eaa638c67",
      "text": "请放宽心！制作人君他，\n可从来不会信口开河喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:007f16c0917a943a9b7fe10ac6a88f6ec83da9b4bd7e6b5919bf27635fc2ad24",
      "text": "非常感谢您，制作人。\n按照这个方案，或许真能实现。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adb261e2bfe16b2868d9f3b4705306f80579357795db3e52e5fda9113e390fc0",
      "text": "真的太感谢了！之后肯定还需要开会讨论细则。\n联系相关各方的事情就交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bf3a12c0571f1444f04d41df35638f4929682bb549bb223a39c53989b9ae073",
      "text": "好的！那就拜托您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000120:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000123:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba6d317ce3a2bfaf3d87ba426113b0a3498828395ba8d093265eb3539b78c491",
      "text": "辛苦了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000123:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7eea3bcd6d0f207bc1a0dfccb0f012664923b623e862802368900b0305af73b6",
      "text": "辛苦了。\n关于赞助的事情，已经顺利\n取得社长的许可了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000126:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51bf828e74cd1bf803552b967810a15b410091dafb0cea97b2c22900579aa083",
      "text": "谢谢你，\n制作人酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000128:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ded5eb5ad8e4960723e654aca569335bc52e9896799179aa2655715e6f329a18",
      "text": "这样一来语音导览的事情，\n应该就能顺利推进下去了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000130:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d497da4e03a58139ec847ef20acce5ad059219e4fec498477b6df3d7bb231c8e",
      "text": "那么，我们在下次会议上，\n立刻敲定导览的详细内容吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000132:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88f5515df15f4c6bad720faa34d63156d576e806cd918a80d72b4a4d6195a6b4",
      "text": "正因为是我们，才有能够\n传达给大家的心意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000134:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf228fb2c598b6478640761522b3d222d8b48b63b532d1775cdd98aad06a5c5c",
      "text": "是的喵！\n在下也会源源不断地\n提出意见喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000136:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b300a44348285197c0f3467704e7c3c59eb3cfbe396455ac666e6d07d1dcfd11",
      "text": "咱从现在开始就已经期待起\n下一次会议了喵～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000138:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8592980c4110a5442514970d0a4f81598dc790be0655ed529196f0cc0332016a",
      "text": "正因为是长久接触日本传统的\n我们，才有能够传达出去的\n话语呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000140:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c10568cd63990997bba9a5c8f81b103443afaac7577c3c352231b559a3cea29",
      "text": "说的正是。录制语音导览时，\n我们也要时刻谨记这一点，\n构思文案吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30011_01:1_3_30011_01_e:cmd-000142:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46cf8c66095cc59f8fb1e8ccb7cdaf9cb952159b0b067a47feeea0b3397c66c4",
      "text": "这一次的宣传，一定要由我们4个人\n一起办得圆满成功喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
